<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (A),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβίωτος, βίος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.715
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be survived,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχύνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					873c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without a living, starving,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				15.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				46.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτεκνος καὶ ἄ. καὶ
			προώλης,</span> an imprecatory form in <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3915.46
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Hierapolis</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> perh. <i>having no fixed subsistence, nomad,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἱππημολγῶν γλακτοφάγων ἀβίων τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.6
				</span></i>
			 (various expl. in Nic.Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.145
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>); but prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀβίων,</span> pr.
			n., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.3.2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄ. Σαυρομάται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Mus.Belg.</u>
					16.70
				</span></i>
			 (Attic, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
